L["Field names are Lua identifiers. Choose a field type from its dropdown. Records contain named fields; allowed types contain alternatives, including nested records."] = "Los nombres de campo son identificadores de Lua. Elige el tipo de campo en su desplegable. Los registros contienen campos con nombre; los tipos permitidos contienen alternativas, incluidos registros anidados."
-- en: "A container carries its nested fields. Drop into a highlighted gap. Up / Down moves within the current container; Duplicate copies the complete field; the red trash can deletes it."
L["A container carries its nested fields. Drop into a highlighted gap. Up / Down moves within the current container; Duplicate copies the complete field; the red trash can deletes it."] = "Un contenedor lleva consigo sus campos anidados. Suelta en un hueco resaltado. Arriba / Abajo mueve dentro del contenedor actual; Duplicar copia el campo completo; la papelera roja lo borra."
-- en: "The chevron hides or shows nested fields. Add field appends to that container. Undo / Redo affect the draft. Apply validates and stages the schema; Cancel leaves the condition unchanged. Red borders mark invalid names or incomplete types."
L["The chevron hides or shows nested fields. Add field appends to that container. Undo / Redo affect the draft. Apply validates and stages the schema; Cancel leaves the condition unchanged. Red borders mark invalid names or incomplete types."] = "El cheurón oculta o muestra los campos anidados. Añadir campo añade al final de ese contenedor. Deshacer / Rehacer afectan al borrador. Aplicar valida y prepara el esquema; Cancelar deja la condición sin cambios. Los bordes rojos marcan nombres no válidos o tipos incompletos."
