-- en: "Arguments become Lua parameters. Bindings expose selected helpers under explicit local aliases. Editing an alias does not rewrite your Lua body."
L["Arguments become Lua parameters. Bindings expose selected helpers under explicit local aliases. Editing an alias does not rewrite your Lua body."] = "Los argumentos se convierten en parámetros de Lua. Los vínculos exponen las funciones auxiliares seleccionadas con alias locales explícitos. Editar un alias no reescribe tu cuerpo Lua."
